      "source": "Create a <a href=\"ColumnName.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>ColumnName</code></a> given <code>CqlIdentifier</code>. The resulting instance uses CQL identifier rules to\nidentify column names (quoting, case-sensitivity).",
